{"unit_id":"tag:03PN:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们可以给<MATH_0001>的任意几何点（geometric point）关联一个正合（exact）的茎（stalk）函子（functor）。<MATH_0002>上的层（sheaves）之间的映射（map）是同构（isomorphism），当且仅当它在所有这些茎（stalks）上都是同构（isomorphism）。阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）的复形（complex）正合（exact），当且仅当茎（stalks）的复形（complex）在所有几何点（geometric points）处都正合（exact）。这些合起来意味着，小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（site），对概形（scheme）<MATH_0003>而言，有足够多的点（enough points）。还可以证明，小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）拓扑斯（topos）的任意点（point），这里是对<MATH_0004>而言（一个抽象概念），都由几何点（geometric point）给出。因此，在某种意义上，小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）拓扑斯（topos），对<MATH_0005>而言，可通过几何点（geometric points）和邻域（neighbourhoods）来理解。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"stalk","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"enough points","target_term":"足够多的点"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"}