{"unit_id":"tag:03PO:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>几何点（geometric point）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，对<MATH_0002>而言，是态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>，其中<MATH_0004>是代数闭的（algebraically closed）。这样的点（point）通常记为<MATH_0005>，即带上划线的小写（small）字母。我们常用<MATH_0006>同时表示概形（scheme）<MATH_0007>及该态射（morphism），并用<MATH_0008>表示<MATH_0009>。\n<STRUCT_0003>我们称<MATH_0010><TEXTITOPEN_0002>位于（lies over）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002><MATH_0011>之上，表示<MATH_0012>是<MATH_0013>的像（image）。\n<STRUCT_0004>一个<TEXTITOPEN_0003>平展邻域（<ACCENT_0001>tale neighborhood）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，对应于几何点（geometric point）<MATH_0014>，它属于<MATH_0015>，是交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0016>\n，其中<MATH_0017>是概形（schemes）的平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）。我们记<MATH_0018>。\n<STRUCT_0005>一个<TEXTITOPEN_0004>平展邻域的态射（morphism of <ACCENT_0003>tale neighborhoods）<TEXTITCLOSE_0004>\n<MATH_0019>\n，是<MATH_0020>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0021>，使<MATH_0022>成立。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraically closed","target_term":"代数闭的"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小写"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"lies over","target_term":"位于"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale neighborhood","target_term":"平展邻域"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism of <ACCENT_0003>tale neighborhoods","target_term":"平展邻域的态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_te